\nPress 'C' or right-click your character and choose 'Inspect Creature' to open the character sheet.\n\nYou have spotted some hostile jellies guarding an item.\nAttack them!\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"近战攻击类似于移动，向你的目标方向移动或者左键点击就可以攻击它。\n如果目标不是敌对的你会和他交谈或者和他交换位置。\n\n近战攻击主要用到以下 5 个属性：\n* #GOLD#命中#WHITE#：你的命中几率。\n* #GOLD#伤害#WHITE#：你所造成的伤害值。\n* #GOLD#闪避#WHITE#：你躲闪攻击的几率。\n* #GOLD#护甲值#WHITE#：固定的伤害减免。\n* #GOLD#护甲穿透#WHITE#：你可以忽视目标多少护甲值。\n\n你可以在角色信息面板中查看你的这些属性值。\n按 'C' 键，或者右键点击你自己的角色并选择“查看生物”，即可打开角色信息面板。\n\n你发现了一些敌对的果冻怪围着一件物品。\n攻击他们！\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"09243c683569ec4a7251d9fbfe9fd6bca8774c8065699dd3fdb8f440afdf81e3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f7854cacdfd2668ccd8b4d6538be36a50361b3609c3d24fbe01ad11c74b164d","logical_entry_identity":"20c43ebd04152bc8013b6a0bb45b4669cd4a71575f9f6b8e0dcc55ab8b9dffcc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"All direct healing done to the target is increased by %d%% and each heal restores %0.1f equilibrium.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标所有受到的治疗增加 %d%%，每次治疗恢复 %0.1f 失衡值。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3d2f42b44f3b294c39d586b66213bbc0d84e29df8a2704ff432367a029ad6815","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f7e92cbfebb8e7cbef8ba7ee3e847f9db607063ab848832d44ff42e60554f44","logical_entry_identity":"906a040539f302943093530faac6c9525f30d4df1a3756dbfb1c6e585ec7b18f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The arcane energy around #target# has dissipated.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#target#周围的奥术能量消失。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"267d28705175253a9330438d91fb44f76c7401db64d0d1715cab98971a6480f1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f8dc10409dac7e04a2d84f1b1869c65a049e346873bca373f4379572f781560","logical_entry_identity":"794d3ee4aef995efcab83ab4ab0879401002bec974ad86ced281ffb62686fc61","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"forest","source_tag":"entity subtype","target":"森林"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"abdde1e513f62f27da35faaa71d9bb0208c48001360a0d36ef8d6d505ff4